public class OverloadDemo {
    // Method 1: calculate square or cube of an integer
    public void calculate(int n, char ch) {
        if (ch == 's' || ch == 'S') {
            System.out.println("Square of " + n + " = " + (n * n));
        } else if (ch == 'c' || ch == 'C') {
            System.out.println("Cube of " + n + " = " + (n * n * n));
        } else {
            System.out.println("Invalid character choice: " + ch);
        }
    }

    // Method 2: calculate product or difference of two doubles
    public void calculate(double a, double b, char ch) {
        if (ch == 'p' || ch == 'P') {
            System.out.println("Product of " + a + " and " + b + " = " + (a * b));
        } else {
            double diff = Math.abs(a - b);
            System.out.println("Absolute difference between " + a + " and " + b + " = " + diff);
        }
    }

    // Method 3: count occurrences of char ch in String str
    public void calculate(String str, char ch) {
        int count = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < str.length(); i++) {
            if (str.charAt(i) == ch) {
                count++;
            }
        }
        System.out.println("Frequency of '" + ch + "' in \"" + str + "\" = " + count);
    }

    // Main method to demonstrate all overloaded methods
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        OverloadDemo demo = new OverloadDemo();

        System.out.println("--- Test Call 1: calculate(int, char) ---");
        demo.calculate(6, 'S');
        demo.calculate(4, 'c');

        System.out.println("\n--- Test Call 2: calculate(double, double, char) ---");
        demo.calculate(12.5, 4.0, 'p');
        demo.calculate(25.5, 40.0, 'd');

        System.out.println("\n--- Test Call 3: calculate(String, char) ---");
        demo.calculate("SUCCESSFUL", 'S');
    }
}
```

### Variable Description Table (VDT):
| Variable Name | Data Type | Purpose / Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `n` | `int` | Integer parameter for square/cube |
| `ch` | `char` | Character parameter controlling operation or search |
| `a`, `b` | `double` | Numeric parameters for product or difference |
| `diff` | `double` | Absolute difference calculated via `Math.abs(a - b)` |
| `str` | `String` | String parameter to be searched |
| `count` | `int` | Counter for frequency of target character in string |
| `demo` | `OverloadDemo` | Object of class to invoke overloaded methods |
